  "body": "Although the spec does not enforce scroll state restoration, I think we still need to spec about at what point(s) should scroll state restoration happen, if it is supported, during parsing,\r\nAlso, what `.focus()` in inline script does in terms of scroll state restoration since browsers currently have an inconsistent behavior of handling this. \r\n\r\nRelated Bugzilla issue: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1173474",
